  "body": "> I'm the maintainer of the AUR -bin package. I don't see any reason the described problem should happen.\n> \n> Before reporting the issue to nautilus devs, I would recommend creating a new user with default, bare profile (ART not yet installed). Log in and change nothing except nautilus shortcut. Confirm shortcut works. Install ART. Check whether nautilus shortcut does or doesn't work.\n\nI just did a fresh Arch install, on a test drive, I set up my custom Nautilus shorcut, confirmed it worked, then I installed ART and confirmed my previously set shortcut for opening Nautilus, now opens ART.\n\nI can also confirm that on my daily driver installation, once I uninstall ART, my custom shortcut resumes it's normal, expected behaviour, as does the mounted drive icon in Dash To Dock.",
